*     Test of channel with symmetrical triangular channel with
*     large values of constant and linearly varying sinuousity.
*     Note that the value of MA is always 1.0 in a symmetrical
*     channel with the distace axis on the line of symmetry.
*     MQ is not 1.0 because our assumption that the decline in
*     the total energy line is constant between two sections
*     entails that the friction slope is no longer constant.
*     This causes an asymmetry in the distribution
*     of flow with more flow taking the shorter path.  Thus
*     MQ will be slightly less than 1.0 in a sinuous symmetrical
*     channel.
 
CHANNEL
SINDEF=LINEAR
HEAD     LFB    AXIS     RFB
 
STAT   0.000   0.000   0.000
OFFS    0.00   10.00   20.00
 
STAT   1.500   1.000   0.500
OFFS    0.00   10.00   20.00
 
STAT   3.000   2.000   1.000
OFFS    0.00   10.00   20.00
 
END
 
FEQX
TABLE#=  900  MONOTONE NEWBETA  NOSAVE   OUT25
STATION=0.00
NAVM=0
NSUB    1     0.050
    OFFSET ELEVATION SUBS  X1  0.01
      0.00     10.00    1
     10.00      0.0     1
     20.00     10.0    -1
 
 
FEQX
TABLE#=  902  MONOTONE NEWBETA  NOSAVE   OUT25
STATION=1.000
NAVM=0
NSUB    1     0.050
    OFFSET ELEVATION SUBS  X1  0.01
      0.00     10.00    1
     10.00      0.0     1
     20.00     10.0    -1
 
FEQX
TABLE#=  904  MONOTONE NEWBETA  NOSAVE   OUT25
STATION=2.000
NAVM=0
NSUB    1     0.050
    OFFSET ELEVATION SUBS  X1  0.01
      0.00     10.00    1
     10.00      0.0     1
     20.00     10.0    -1
 
ENDCHAN
 
 
*     Test of channel with symmetrical rectangular channel
*     for which we can compute the value of Mq by analytical
*     integration.  When we do this and evaluate the
*     resulting integrals at their limits we find that
*     MQ = 0.95534.
 
 
CHANNEL
SINDEF=PARABOLA
HEAD     LFB    AXIS     RFB
 
STAT   0.000   0.000   0.000
OFFS    0.00   10.00   20.00
 
STAT   1.500   1.000   0.500
OFFS    0.00   10.00   20.00
 
STAT   3.000   2.000   1.000
OFFS    0.00   10.00   20.00
 
END
 
FEQX
