FWFOTRAN= 0.2
MAXHEAD= 60.0
MINHEAD= 2.0
PRECISION= 0.02
   Opening 2-D_Table  Cc_Value Lip_Angle
      0.5       5901                39.4
      1.0       5902                40.7
      2.0       5903                43.3
      4.0       5904                48.2
      8.0       5905                56.9
     12.0       5906                64.9
     16.0       5907                72.4
     24.0       5908                86.5
     26.0       5909                90.0
     32.0       5910               100.4
      -1.0
Partial free drop parameters
